## Develop
See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). `uvx --from rust-just just check` must pass.

## Secrets
Values live in `secrets.enc.env` (SOPS, age; recipient in `.sops.yaml`). Add one with
`sops set secrets.enc.env '["DATABASE_PASSWORD"]' '"<value>"'`; names are listed in `service.yaml` (`run.env`).

## Release
From a dev machine, with this checkout and the homelab checkout side by side, run
`tools/release.sh {{ name }} [--minor]` from the homelab repo: it merges `dev` into `main`,
waits for CI on `main` to pass, tags, pins the tag in `veronica.yaml` and deploys. A Version
bump on `dev` must be followed by `uv lock`; the tool checks that.
